<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
How does this config work:
- Every <Bullet> line is one bullet look. Weapons in Weapons.xml use the index number.
- fileName = the bullet prefab. isModel = 1 if it is a 3D model, 0 if not.
- hitType = the hit effect, as an index from Effect.xml.

How to add a new bullet type into this config:
  1. Copy the last <Bullet ... /> line and paste it at the END of the list.
  2. Set index to the next number (last index + 1). Do not skip numbers. The game finds bullets by their place in the list.
  3. Set fileName, isModel and hitType.
  4. Use the new index as Bullet type in Weapons.xml.
-->
<!-- Bullet Data -->
<Bullets>
